<title>SENEGAL: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICAN GROUP 3 RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICAN GROUP 3 RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DAKAR 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Davis Cup tennis Euro/African Zone group 3 Zone A singles matches on Friday:</p>
<p>Pascal Schaul (Luxembourg) beat Jean Noel Said (Senegal)  6-4 6-4.</p>
<p>Yahiya Doumbia (Senegal) beat Adria Graimprey (Luxembourg) 5-7 6-4 6-2.</p>
<p>Alaaddin Karagoz (Turkey) beat Lazar Magdincev (Macedonia) 6-4 6-4.</p>
<p>Zoran Sevcenko (Macedonia) beat Baris Ergun (Turkey) 6-4  6-0.</p>
<p> Eldar Mustafic (Bosnia) beat Artak Harutyunyan (Armenia)   6-3 6-3.</p>
<p>Merid Zahirovic (Bosnia) beat David Babayan (Armenia) 6-2 6-1.</p>
<p>Christian Rosti (San Marino) beat Habtamu Kidane (Ethiopia) 6-4 6-1.</p>
<p>Domenico Vicini (San Marino) beat Samuel Gebriel (Ethiopia) 6-2 6-4.</p>
</text>
